<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets warrants on mark/dollar rate.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on mark/dollar rate.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc says it has issued 500,000 range warrants, in two equal tranches, on the mark/dollar rate.</p>
<p>Payout is linked to the ranges between the issue date and the expiry date.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	ISS PRICE	SPOT	LOWER	UPPER</p>
<p> RANGE 1	 $7.57	    1.6375    1.56	 1.72</p>
<p> RANGE 2	 $7.57	    1.6375    1.53	 1.78</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   29.AUG.97		 PAYDATE	11.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT ONE</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
